    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "Inactive on purpose. Run with **Execute workflow** only.\n\nKeep one copy of this workflow per n8n and reuse it for every QA run. When `acceptanceVersion` in **Settings** is older than the file in the Relmio repository, update this workflow in place instead of importing a second copy.\n\nCredentials: **OpenAI Relmio** (the sidecar, Base URL `http://n8n-openai-oauth:10531/v1`) on every node except the local model, and **Relmio Local Model** (Base URL `http://n8n-local-model:11434/v1`) on Local Chat Model. On another self-hosted n8n, set `sidecarBaseUrl` in **Settings** and the credential Base URL to the address that n8n reaches the sidecar at.\n\nSet the text model in **Settings**. Each check node keeps going on error, so open its output: a check passes only when it shows the expected text.",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 420
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000016",
      "name": "Before you run",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -520,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Expected results\n\n- HTTP Request: Responses returns `http responses ok`\n- HTTP Request: Chat Completions returns `http chat ok`\n- AI Agent returns `391`, and its `intermediateSteps` show one Calculator call that returned `391`\n- Basic LLM Chain returns `chain ok`\n- OpenAI: Message a Model returns `openai node ok`\n- OpenAI: Generate an Image returns one binary image (image add-on only)\n- Local Model Chain returns `4` (local model only)\n\nAn `error` field in any output is a failure.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 420
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000017",
      "name": "Expected results",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -520,
        440
      ]
    }
